      "id": "intro",
      "text": "Forty-two point seven million visitors in one single year. A new record. The best travel country on Earth? This is Japan.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "hook"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "where",
      "text": "The World Economic Forum now ranks Japan number one in the world for travel and tourism, ahead of the United States. This island nation sits on the edge of the Pacific Ocean, facing South Korea, China and Russia across the Sea of Japan. Its capital is Tokyo.",
