    {
      "id": "stats",
      "text": "Japan covers about three hundred and seventy-eight thousand square kilometres, a little bigger than Germany. The latest census counted around one hundred and twenty-three million people, and almost a third of them live in the Greater Tokyo area. So where does all the magic come from? Let's count down.",
