    },
    {
      "id": "cities",
      "text": "Number three: the cities. Tokyo is one of the largest metropolitan areas on Earth, and Yokohama is right next door. Osaka is famous for street food, Nagoya for industry, and Sapporo for its snow festival. Down in the south, Hiroshima and Fukuoka complete the map.",
