    {
      "id": "culture",
      "text": "Number two: food and culture. Ramen, sushi and street food in every town, from tiny counters to famous markets. Cherry blossoms that turn whole cities pink in spring. Steaming hot spring baths in the mountains. And quiet shrines where time seems to slow down.",
