      "id": "train",
      "text": "Getting around is part of the fun. Since nineteen sixty-four, bullet trains have linked Tokyo with Nagoya, Kyoto and Osaka at close to three hundred kilometres an hour, and the line now runs west to Hiroshima and Fukuoka. Trains here are famous for running exactly on time.",
