    {
      "id": "boom",
      "text": "Number one: everyone wants to go. Japan welcomed about twenty-five million visitors in twenty twenty-three, nearly thirty-seven million in twenty twenty-four, and a record forty-two point seven million in twenty twenty-five. That is more than ever before. Together they spent around nine and a half trillion yen.",
