    {
      "id": "change",
      "text": "But twenty twenty-six looks different. After Beijing advised its citizens against travelling to Japan, visitors from mainland China fell by more than half in the first months of the year. Meanwhile South Korea and Taiwan sent record numbers, and July was the busiest July ever.",
