    {
      "id": "next",
      "text": "So what comes next? The government's goal is sixty million visitors a year by twenty thirty. Busy places like Kyoto are learning to manage the crowds, while quieter regions such as Tohoku, Shikoku and Hokkaido hope to welcome many more travellers.",
